+| 2025-11-04, step 0 | `DEMAND_CAPPED` | N/A | N/A | N/A | N/A | 3518.587 → 3571.681 | 100 → 100 | 72 → 100 |
+| 2025-11-04, step 0 | `ATTAINMENT_ONLY` | N/A | N/A | N/A | N/A | 3518.587 → 3571.681 | 100 → 100 | 72 → 100 |
